OL,3,GNEWSAIslamophobia 'as bad as it was in
OL,4,Athe 1980s'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of a 13-year-old boy who was
OL,7,Fmurdered by a fellow pupil in their
OL,8,Fschool playground 40 years ago has said
OL,9,FIslamophobia "is as bad as it was in
OL,10,Fthe 1980s".
OL,12,FAhmed Iqbal Ullah, a British
OL,13,FBangladeshi, was stabbed at Burnage
OL,14,FHigh School in Manchester on 17
OL,15,FSeptember 1986.
OL,17,FA subsequent inquiry into the
OL,18,Fteenager's death examining racism and
OL,19,Fviolence in Manchester's schools
OL,20,Fconcluded that race was a key factor in
OL,21,Fthe Bangladeshi's murder.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
