OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIslamophobia 'as bad as it was in
OL,4,Athe 1980s'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on the 40th anniversary of
OL,7,FAhmed's loss, Selina Ullah said: "I've
OL,8,Fgot children and grandchildren now and
OL,9,Ffor them to experience what I
OL,10,Fexperienced - what my generation, my
OL,11,Ffriends, my brother experienced - is
OL,12,Fheartbreaking and terrifying."
